[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0010","text":"０m"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0020","text":"不点击的话\n就不会开始"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0030","text":"啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0040","text":"游戏开始"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0050","text":"寿司浮在空中了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0060","text":"这个\n会动的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0070","text":"是『寿司叠叠乐游戏』吧～？\n先放到地上试试看嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0080","text":"堆起来，叠上去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0090","text":"啊哈～\n寿司塌掉了呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0100","text":"……呐、呐，大家"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0110","text":"离演唱会还有，这种时候……\n像平时这样，真的好吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0120","text":"没什么不好的吧～？\n雏菜她们，有好好在训练啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0130","text":"话、话是这么说……\n但是，光是这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0140","text":"不安吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0150","text":"……大家呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0160","text":"人数也多，大家也都在活跃\n我们没必要太往前冲"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0170","text":"雏菜超级期待的～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0180","text":"没关系\n总会有办法的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0190","text":"……这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0200","text":"那，下一个雏菜来～\n看着哦，透前辈～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0210","text":"嗯／……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0220","text":"……我、我还是听一下演唱会的歌吧\n戴一边耳机，可以吗……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0230","text":"游戏开始～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0240","text":"０m"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0250","text":"200m"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0260","text":"2000m"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0270","text":"能飞多远？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0280","text":"声音\n重叠的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0290","text":"──啊，透前辈～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0300","text":"小糸\n给我，歌"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0310","text":"……？\n──啊，嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0320","text":"……\n啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0330","text":"不对\n不是不唱吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0340","text":"啊哈～，雏菜也～！\n……啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0350","text":"你们俩也"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0351","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0360","text":"啊……\n啊──……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0361","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0370","text":"啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0380","text":"啊──／啊──／啊──……！／啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0390","text":"还不够\n继续叠"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_02010000_06_0400","text":"再坚强一点"}]
